            <p style="margin-bottom: 25px;line-height: 27px;">GRM Overseas (BSE: 531449) R is an India-based company engaged in the business of consumer staples. The company was incorporated in 1995 and is based in Panipat, India. The Company produces a range of items for its customers spread across the world.</p>
